 include/linux/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.h   |   17 +
 include/uapi/misc/qseecom-fpc.h          |   71 ++
 6 files changed, 1703 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_qseecom_fpc.c
 create mode 100644 include/uapi/misc/qseecom-fpc.h

